//   node tools/physics-support/source-fetch-check.mjs --coverage <a,b,...> --stamp   # fetch + stamp
//   node tools/physics-support/source-fetch-check.mjs --coverage <a,b,...>           # gate: stamps exist
//
// Owner instruction (2026-08-17): dead and stale URLs from academic sources
