+| def-aqft-derivative-expansion-and-truncation | Formal expansion of the positive heavy kernel in A/M²; order N is finite-range at the declared graph regulator, with no generic convergence or error claim. | def-aqft-model-and-scale-data; def-aqft-wilsonian-action | Kaplan §§1.1–1.2; Burgess §2.2.4. | Authored with a two-step finite-range proof. Scoped validation and Step-1 readiness pending. |
