+| texp-aqft-finite-heavy-scalar-matching | Exact normalized finite Gaussian source shift plus the spectral-band inverse-kernel and action remainder bounds for E<M. | model, Wilsonian-action, and derivative definitions; AC/ACω inputs; lem-qftx-finite-heavy-gaussian-square; def-qftx-heavy-gaussian-data; thm-qftx-heavy-derivative-bound | Kaplan §2.2; Burgess §§2.2.1–2.2.5; Moshayedi §11.2. | Authored as a conditional model deduction. It does not integrate the optional gauge sector or claim continuum existence. Scoped validation and Step-1 readiness pending. |
