+- David B. Kaplan, Five lectures on effective field theory, https://arxiv.org/pdf/nucl-th/0510023; full 79-page lecture-notes PDF retrieved. Read §§1.1–1.2 and §2.2, including the low-energy local-operator definition and finite matching discussion. Supports the three definitions and conditional physical interpretation. `source-fetch-check --stamp`: 827,908 bytes, 79 pages, SHA256 prefix `301509f99f75f144`.
